[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 28572.23, "timestamp": "07:56:12", "text": "上的顏色變成了橙色。  砲塔撤出。  如果我瞄準得好，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28575.35, "timestamp": "07:56:15", "text": "我能得到什麼？我創造了社會，為什麼眼睛會讀到這些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28584.67, "timestamp": "07:56:24", "text": "？哦，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28601.388, "timestamp": "07:56:41", "text": "的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28613.35, "timestamp": "07:56:53", "text": "潘多拉偏執狂誘餌在哪裡？什麼是偏執狂誘餌？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28616.23, "timestamp": "07:56:56", "text": "哦，好的。好的"}]